## 🔧 **Technical Implementation Details**

### **Database Schema Enhancements**
```sql
-- Enhanced UserActivity table with rich metadata
ALTER TABLE "UserActivity" ADD COLUMN "title" TEXT;
ALTER TABLE "UserActivity" ADD COLUMN "description" TEXT;
ALTER TABLE "UserActivity" ADD COLUMN "is_personal" BOOLEAN DEFAULT false;
ALTER TABLE "UserActivity" ADD COLUMN "priority" TEXT DEFAULT 'medium';
ALTER TABLE "UserActivity" ADD COLUMN "related_user_id" INTEGER;
ALTER TABLE "UserActivity" ADD COLUMN "prediction_id" INTEGER;
ALTER TABLE "UserActivity" ADD COLUMN "bet_id" INTEGER;

-- Achievement system tables
CREATE TABLE "Achievement" (
  "id" SERIAL PRIMARY KEY,
  "name" TEXT UNIQUE NOT NULL,
  "title" TEXT NOT NULL,
  "description" TEXT NOT NULL,
  "category" TEXT NOT NULL,
  "targetValue" INTEGER NOT NULL,
  "iconUrl" TEXT,
  "isActive" BOOLEAN DEFAULT true
);

CREATE TABLE "UserAchievement" (
  "id" SERIAL PRIMARY KEY,
  "userId" INTEGER REFERENCES "User"("id"),
  "achievementId" INTEGER REFERENCES "Achievement"("id"),
  "progress" INTEGER DEFAULT 0,
  "completedAt" TIMESTAMP,
  UNIQUE("userId", "achievementId")
);
```

### **Service Integration Points**
- **Betting Service**: Achievement triggers on bet placement, volume tracking
- **Prediction Service**: Achievement triggers on prediction creation
- **User Service**: Achievement triggers on social actions (follow/unfollow)
- **Real-time Updates**: Socket.IO events for all statistics and achievement changes

### **Performance Optimizations**
- **Optimized Prisma Queries**: Efficient category accuracy and streak calculations
- **Database Indexes**: Optimized for real-time activity and achievement queries
- **Redis Caching**: Framework ready for Phase 4 caching implementation
- **Error Handling**: Graceful fallbacks for all new services

